WEBVTT

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.150
Hooray!

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.660
The look on their faces when we seized
those smuggled goods was priceless.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.750
It went exactly as planned!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.870
No, that was a close shave.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:47.130
Who knows what would've
happened if we failed to escape?

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:51.550
We made it out alive only because
Lowa secured an escape route.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.550
That's true.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.930
But she's also the prime instigator.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.050
You knew a do-or-die
thrill was baked right in.

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.350
Did I, now?

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.140
You'll never change.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.520
I hope you'll settle down
once you graduate.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.900
These things have a way
of catching up to you.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.820
Duly noted.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.650
But I don't think I'll ever change.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.490
I hope you'll always stay the same, too.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:20.780
Huh?

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.870
I'll come visit you when the time is ripe.

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:30.750
You're awake?

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:33.000
I had a dream that brought back memories.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.420
About?

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:38.550
Our classmates at the military academy.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.930
I wonder what they're up to.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:43.060
Same old things, no doubt.

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:46.730
So, Ninym, do I really have
to wear this formal attire?

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:48.650
It's so damn tight.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.480
Don't be such a baby.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:54.690
You must be appropriately dressed
when receiving the imperial princess.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:02:00.160
No, <i>she </i>should follow the appropriate
etiquette before showing up!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:04.490
I don't care if she said it's to
"confirm and strengthen our alliance."

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.040
It was <i>so </i>last minute!

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:09.670
Now now, it seems things have
been pretty hectic for her, too.

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.630
Three imperial princes
vying for the throne?

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.500
Why should I even care?

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:20.300
Well, if one of the princes would visit,
we might be able to gauge their intent.

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:23.390
But a princess? Why is she here?

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:28.230
Your Highness, the princess's delegation
has arrived ahead of schedule.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:37.820
"Princess Lowellmina Earthwold,
Empire of Earthwold"

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:41.820
I bid you welcome.
My father is too ill to be here.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:46.750
I am Natra's prince regent,
Wein Salema Arbalest.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:52.210
We thank you for your warm
greeting despite our sudden visit.

00:02:52.210 --> 00:02:54.920
I thank you for traveling all this way.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.010
May you find comfort here.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:57.880
And this is...?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:02.010
I would like to introduce
our imperial princess.

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:06.890
We are here to offer Her Highness's
hand in marriage to you, Your Highness.

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:09.520
--What?
--Marriage?!

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:14.020
I am Lowellmina Earthwold,
second princess of the empire.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.990
It's been ages since I've seen you, Wein.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:23.700
Marriage?!

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:26.030
This is guaranteed to be a trap!

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.660
I hope this all turns out to be a dream.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.580
It won't.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.960
It won't, will it?!

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:35.590
I never expected
the princess would be Lowa.

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:39.760
She's from the imperial family?!
She said she was a backwater noble!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.930
She hid the truth at the academy!

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:45.100
You could say the same about yourself.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.100
Still, you and Lowa are two peas in a pod.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:50.730
It would be interesting
to see you together.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.770
This isn't funny!

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:54.690
I know you remember!

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.230
After Lowa became friends
with us at the academy,

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:59.940
we were always skating on thin ice!

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:02.200
How could I forget?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.570
We hunted down brigands,
exposed a corrupt bureaucrat,

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.200
and sold off the smuggled goods
we seized from crooked merchants.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.870
We got away with a lot.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.250
Most of it was Lowa's idea.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:16.130
And you were her most
enthusiastic coconspirator.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:20.380
At any rate, Lowa plots and
schemes as easily as she breathes!

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:24.090
There is no way she's
here simply to marry me!

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:26.720
She is <i>definitely </i>up to something!

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:30.520
What a surprise.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:34.230
I didn't expect to be eating
imperial cuisine in your land.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:38.520
After such a long and tiring trip, you
must miss your homeland's food.

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:42.360
So I thought, tonight at least,
we should eat what you're accustomed to.

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:46.070
I am grateful for your hospitality,
Prince Wein.

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.370
Are you really?

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.490
What?

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:52.450
That marriage proposal you mentioned.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:56.040
I'm embarrassed to say
I'm but a backwater noble.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.210
So I'm wondering what an imperial
princess could possibly see in me.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.470
Oh my, now you're being modest.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:06.430
You've led your kingdom
during your father's illness

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.180
and were victorious in a war with Marden.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.510
Your brave name has reached
as far as our empire.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:15.810
As a woman, it is only natural
that I would be interested.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:20.440
My brothers tried to stop me,
but coming here was the right choice.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.440
So, you <i>did </i>meet resistance
from those around you.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.990
Yes. That's why most of my delegation
consists of my brothers' liegemen.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.450
They said it was not safe and
told their men to escort me here.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.910
It is <i>truly </i>stifling.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:36.960
Well, I, myself,
am a big brother with a little sister.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:40.340
So I'm afraid I must
take your brothers' side.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.540
So that's it.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.840
Her sudden visit is due to
an infatuation with a foreign prince

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.430
resulting from
uncontrollable adolescent urges?!

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.760
And she claims, "It's an official visit!"

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.010
But that's just the cover story
she's trying to pass off.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:55.480
Naturally, I'm not buying a word of it.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:59.150
But then there are all those
liegemen loyal to her brothers.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:03.150
Being a girl and the youngest,
she wouldn't have many followers.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:06.400
And the fact that
she dared to admit that--

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.490
You know, the Natran winter
is far colder than I'd heard.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:14.410
I'll present you with some traditional
Natran attire if you'd like.

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:19.370
Imperial garb is exquisitely designed,
but it's not quite warm enough, is it?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.090
Thank you for your concern.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.630
I shall accept your kind offer.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.140
Your Highness?

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.600
Forgive the intrusion.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:39.640
Prince Wein has sent something for you.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:43.360
It must be the attire he mentioned.
Bring it in, please.

00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:44.610
Your Highness.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:52.120
All right, you can come out now.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:55.910
I wanted to startle you!

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.580
What gave it away?

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:00.250
It was so obvious! That's why!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.540
How about using a rope to sneak
in through a window next time?

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.340
Okay, I'll be the official rope cutter.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:09.470
Whoa, Ninym,
dial down the murderous intent.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.720
Your banter is just like it was
back at the academy.

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:18.180
It's nice to see you again, Ninym.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.810
I'm glad to see
you're still by Wein's side.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:25.020
I'm glad to see you're doing well, Lowa.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:29.490
Or perhaps I should call you
Your Imperial Highness?

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:31.780
Skip the formalities.

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.240
We're friends, are we not?

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:37.870
Please call me Lowa just like you used to.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:42.580
All right, I'll do so in private.

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.540
You two haven't changed a bit.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.750
I have!

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.380
I've grown taller and even better looking.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.260
And Ninym has plumped up
except for her boobs.

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:55.220
Wait, Ninym!
That was just a little verbal jab.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:58.600
Then I'll counter with a cross.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.810
Lowa, help!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:03.690
So, Wein. Notice
anything different about me?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.690
Did your butt get bigger?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.280
Ninym, hit him with your best shot.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.030
Okay.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:16.780
Your Highness?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.950
I heard voices.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:21.870
Ambassador Brandel?!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.160
Good timing.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.920
Fisch, please stand
guard outside the door.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.460
If anyone comes,
tell them I'm already in bed.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:30.170
Yes, but--

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.420
Fisch!

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:35.840
Understood. Please call
for me should anything happen.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.510
Yes, thank you.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:41.600
I get it.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:46.980
You prepared for your visit by
having her gather information here.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:51.280
That's right. I had her transferred
directly under me from Foreign Affairs.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:56.200
Plus, a certain someone was giving
her busy work that stifled her growth.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:00.580
To think you were really a princess.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:04.500
Did you know who Ninym and I
really were back at the academy?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.170
Of course, I did.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.500
And one time, I actually asked Ninym.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.420
I said, "Are you two really commoners?"

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.630
Yes, you did ask, didn't you?

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:19.140
I did. And you replied,
"We're just commoners."

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.060
So tell me, Ninym Ralei.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.770
Why did you lie to your good friend?

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.850
As if I'd ever lie to you.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.940
It was just a mistake.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:32.320
You'll forgive a friend who
makes a mistake, won't you,

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:34.990
Princess Lowellmina Earthwold?

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.070
Of course, Ninym.

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:42.580
That's what I love about you.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.620
May I give you a hug?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:49.000
Y-You're always playing games
when you know you can get away with it.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.630
You should really do something about that.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.210
And I never said yes to this hug,

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:56.420
so get off me!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.130
That's just who I am.

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:01.720
The imperial family is
full of personality disorders.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.310
So, now that we're here, let's talk.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:11.770
Let's hear your true objective,
not all that nonsense about a marriage.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.480
All right.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.490
Wein.

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:19.030
Would you like to seize
the empire with me?

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.740
Seize the empire together?

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:29.790
You're asking me to help push aside
three princes and make you empress?

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:31.000
Precisely.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.500
That's going way too far.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.670
You know my kingdom's limits.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.260
There's nothing here that would
enable us to confront the empire.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:45.060
The empire could easily snuff out
your kingdom if it put its mind to it.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:50.350
But my brothers are in a three-way
power struggle over the throne.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:53.020
So they <i>can't </i>put their mind to it.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:53.980
That's right.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:11:00.530
And the only way to prevent further chaos
is for me to ascend to the throne.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:04.660
Sadly, I don't have anyone
of influence willing to back me,

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.700
at least not in my homeland.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.290
They're all cozying up
to one brother or another

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.000
while ignoring me because I'm a woman.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.750
And that's why I had no choice
but to seek help from my old friends.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.340
That being said, isn't this
the most thrilling situation ever?

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:21.260
Yeah, uber-thrilling.

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.300
Wein?

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:24.050
I know.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:28.220
Unlike my days at the academy,
I'm now crown prince, much to my regret.

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:31.060
I can't simply agree to such a proposal.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:35.230
I never expected you
to agree after a single talk.

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:37.900
So then you've come
prepared to get my help?

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:41.150
What's your ace in the hole?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.910
What is it, indeed?

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:47.200
You two really are two peas in a pod.

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.790
She's bluffing.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.670
She doesn't really want your help?

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:58.170
Yeah. Have you ever known Lowa
to ask for anything that directly?

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.970
True, but Lowa's objective
is even more mysterious

00:12:00.970 --> 00:12:05.720
if the marriage proposal was a pretext
and the request for help a bluff.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:11.310
I <i>have </i>noticed suspicious weapons
being distributed around Natra lately.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:14.400
Weapons? What does
that have to do with Lowa?

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:20.320
It's still just a suspicion,
but I'll get to the bottom of it.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.820
Ninym.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.200
Nanaki.

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:28.370
I'm sorry, but I need to ask a favor.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:36.460
I don't know why, but I feel so anxious.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:42.970
After my father fell ill,
my brother became prince regent,

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:47.390
and now he might get married.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:53.730
Everything's changing around me,
and I feel like I'm being left behind.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.770
It's as you say, Your Highness.

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:59.400
Our kingdom is experiencing major changes.

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.820
However, not everything will change.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:08.530
No matter how things around you change,
some things will always stay the same.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.240
Like what?

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:16.080
Prince Wein will always cherish you,
and you will always cherish him.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:21.050
That will never change,
even if he takes a bride.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:24.380
Just as Your Highness
admires your big brother,

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:28.800
Prince Wein truly
adores his little sister.

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:30.890
Ninym.

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:34.680
Thank you. Hearing you say
that puts my mind at ease.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.650
I'm simply stating the truth.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.900
But I was wondering.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:44.110
What do you think about
my brother getting married?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:48.620
I always thought he would marry you.

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:53.040
You are always together,
and you care about each other.

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:57.250
I'm happy that Your Highness
has given it so much thought,

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:00.540
but I won't be marrying Prince Wein.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.800
Why not?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:07.090
His Highness is Crown Prince
of Natra, and I'm a Flahm.

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:11.600
If Prince Wein ever said
he'd take me as his bride,

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:16.770
I'm afraid I'd have to slit my own
throat for leading His Highness astray.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:17.940
How awful!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.480
Oh, no.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:24.230
That's just how I feel.
I'd never actually harm myself.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.900
And I don't need to become his consort,

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:31.030
for he has bestowed an
even greater honor upon me.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:32.200
Like what?

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:36.540
He said I was his heart.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.920
Just as there is but one sun
and one moon, he has but one heart.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:45.550
Until the day Prince Wein's
long journey comes to an end,

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:50.180
he will only allow me to be his heart.

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.970
I don't really get it.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.390
That reminds me.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:59.940
It seems you haven't been
making great strides in your studies,

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:01.980
or so the rumors say.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:07.070
I wonder. Might this be a chance
to get your lord brother involved?

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:08.990
Will you come with me?!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:13.160
Forgive me, but I have a prior commitment.

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:19.120
What a truly wonderful place.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:22.960
I am honored that it's to your liking,
Your Imperial Highness.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.210
However...

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:26.550
Is something the matter?

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:29.760
Why have I joined
Your Highness in the bath?

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:33.510
Did we not bathe together
many times at the academy?

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:35.810
We now occupy entirely different stations.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:39.890
Let's cast away such notions,
just as we did our clothes.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.480
Yes, but...

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:45.570
I'm saying you can speak to me
in a more casual manner.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:48.070
Fine, just for now.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:52.950
Pardon me, Your Highness.
This is merely out of curiosity, but...

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:58.410
What was life like for both of you
when you were at the academy?

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:04.040
Well, in addition to Wein, Ninym,
and me, there were Glen and Strang.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.920
The five of us were
always doing things together.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.460
We were the talk of the academy.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.550
Don't you mean its plague?

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.720
No, everyone loved us.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.220
Especially you, Ninym.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.930
After that big ado over the duel,
even the girls respected you.

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:21.640
A duel?

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:25.980
Someone insulted me for being a Flahm,
so I challenged them to a duel

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.900
and gave them a good thrashing.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:32.150
Many a gentleman was
charmed by your gallant form.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.360
I could say the same of you, Lowa.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:38.080
There's still no end to the
nobles seeking your affection.

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.710
Isn't your most avid
suitor the Antgatal's son?

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:45.790
Yes, Sir Gerard.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.960
Ever since I saw him at that party,

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:52.670
he's been sending gifts and
letters that are of such poor taste.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:55.840
I'm not used to hearing
you say things like that.

00:16:55.840 --> 00:17:02.310
I really hope he finally gives up
once he finds out I've come here.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:05.350
Gerard Antgatal?

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.650
Now then, let the tutoring session begin!

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:12.030
I'm ready!

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:16.820
By the way, what has Gladius
been teaching you these days?

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:20.330
Well, I've been learning about the empire.

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.290
Burnoch, Antgatal, and other kingdoms

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:27.210
were combined to form
the empire we know today.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.630
That's right.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:32.300
How about we talk about Antgatal today?

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:36.220
Our kingdom, Natra, is in the far north,
right in the middle of the continent.

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:39.930
To the east, there's the province of
Gairan, which is part of the empire.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:43.850
But it was once an independent
kingdom known as Antgatal

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:47.400
until the empire annexed it
before we were born.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:51.650
The events leading up to that are
why the former king of Antgatal is known

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:54.280
as the greatest charlatan
on the continent.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.820
What do you mean?

00:17:55.820 --> 00:18:00.160
Back then, the empire had conquered
the south and wanted to rapidly expand.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:06.500
Sensing a threat, the nations in the
east formed an anti-empire alliance.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:10.750
That's when the tables turned,
and the empire was backed into a corner.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.590
It slowly lost territory,

00:18:12.590 --> 00:18:16.630
and if this had continued,
the empire probably would've fallen.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:20.010
But the king of Antgatal,
an alliance member,

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:25.060
suddenly sided with the empire,
thereby vastly changing the situation.

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:26.430
He betrayed the alliance?!

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.480
That's right.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:31.310
And the traitor king used
clever diplomacy to stall for time.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:36.110
Meanwhile, the empire obliterated
the alliance-member nations.

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.990
The alliance finally collapsed,

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:42.280
and the east fell completely
under imperial rule.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.700
The royalty of the
major kingdoms were punished

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.500
but not the King of Antgatal.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:50.580
He was made a marquess
and given his own land to govern.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:56.420
That's how the first Marquess of Antgatal
became known as a charlatan.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:59.090
Their first marquess? So then...

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:05.470
That's right. He passed away,
so now his son is the second marquess.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:10.440
But his son is now a grown man
with children older than us.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.900
Is he as extraordinary as his father?

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:16.320
I've never confirmed this firsthand,

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:19.150
but I hear he's brutish,
tyrannical, and militarily inept.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.950
He inherited his
father's looks and ambition,

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:26.080
but not his courage or wisdom,
or so everyone says.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.000
What an awful reputation.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:31.920
On top of that, he's at odds
with the viceroy of Gairan.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.210
Pardon me, Your Highness.

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.590
We seized some of the suspicious weapons.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.050
Well done.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:44.680
They appear to be new
but not of Natran make.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:46.180
That's not good.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.560
Highness?

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:49.600
I wish to send a letter at once.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.020
Highness!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:57.690
Now you've done it, Lowellmina!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.040
Where's your head at, Lowa?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:10.790
I was simply watching.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.290
Watching what?

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.340
You.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:18.460
So you've finally noticed my good looks.

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.380
No, I haven't.

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.380
You haven't?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.260
I haven't.

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:23.090
Even a little?

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:26.260
--I haven't.
--Stop saying that!

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.770
How can I put this?

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:33.140
You don't have a care in the world.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.770
I envy that.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:36.190
What? Is this a fight?

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.730
Are you picking a fight with me?

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:41.320
No, I really mean it.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:43.490
I really do envy you.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.370
I know what's eating at you.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.780
You want to do something important,

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.540
but your family won't
let you do anything unladylike.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.870
That's it, isn't it?

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.250
How did you know?!

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.630
Top of your class at the academy.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:00.800
Fearless when competing with men.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:04.050
The confidence to
assert yourself as equal.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:05.550
And the list goes on.

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:09.180
Put it all together,
and it's as plain as day.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:15.060
So, if you wanted to ask me
what you should do, here's my answer:

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:16.730
Start a war!

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.020
What?

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.740
The problem you're
facing isn't your family.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:26.530
It's the empire's, no, the continent's
engrained culture and ideology.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:30.330
One can't even fathom
how deep and weighty they are.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.500
But ultimately, they're
the product <i>of </i>people <i>for </i>people.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:38.000
They're no more than local customs
such as language and manners.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.670
Local customs?

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:42.670
Where once we ate with our hands,

00:21:42.670 --> 00:21:46.180
it's now customary
to use a knife and fork.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:47.510
Why is that?

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:50.140
Because that's what everyone does.

00:21:50.140 --> 00:21:53.310
Right. Someone spread
that custom long ago,

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:55.520
and it became culturally entrenched.

00:21:55.520 --> 00:22:00.190
As a result, the idea and custom
of eating with our hands died out.

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:03.030
You could say the same of male chauvinism.

00:22:03.030 --> 00:22:06.280
What I'm saying is
the future can be changed.

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:11.490
So, Lowa, if you wish to reject the
ideology that runs rampant in society,

00:22:11.490 --> 00:22:15.210
your only option is to strengthen
your ideology and wage war.

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:19.420
Or you can submit to social norms
and lead a life feeling dead inside.

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:21.340
Your choice.

00:22:23.630 --> 00:22:26.420
Listen, Wein.

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:31.100
This is a big if,
but if I choose to fight,

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:32.680
would you help me?

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:34.520
What? No way.

00:22:34.520 --> 00:22:36.770
Ouch! What was that for?!

00:22:36.770 --> 00:22:39.150
This is where you're supposed to say yes!

00:22:39.150 --> 00:22:42.440
Don't be stupid!
I have my own fish to fry!

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:43.940
Like what?!

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.950
All sorts of things! All sorts!

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:49.660
But honestly, it's all a pain in the ass.

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:53.410
I'll probably bail
before I see any of it through.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:57.290
So, I was thinking, Lowa...

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.870
Yes, go on.

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:04.710
If you really need us, why not
just drag us in without asking?

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:07.760
Of course, I'll try
to avoid it at all costs.

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:13.760
But if I fail to make a clean escape,
I might help out a bit.

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:18.180
Wein, you really are a strange one.

00:23:18.180 --> 00:23:21.560
You're the last person
I want to hear that from.

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.900
I guess we're just two peas in a pod.

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:37.330
Good morning.
Did Your Highness sleep well?

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:38.750
Yes.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:42.630
Fisch, I don't have anything
important scheduled today, do I?

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:47.670
Actually, the prince regent
has invited you to tea.

00:23:48.760 --> 00:23:51.800
Prince Wein?

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:57.270
Knowing Wein, there's no way
he's just interested in small talk.

00:23:57.270 --> 00:24:02.400
He's either digging for information,
or he's up to something else.

00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:03.770
Whichever it is...

00:24:03.770 --> 00:24:06.230
What shall tell the prince?

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:08.570
Tell him I'd be delighted.
